WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.715 --> 00:00:09.035
RepBunny times your rest after every set, so you know when to go again.

2
00:00:09.391 --> 00:00:10.351
Here's how.

3
00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:14.789
On Home, tap a routine to start it, like Push day.

4
00:00:15.138 --> 00:00:19.618
Log your first set with the check button. Your rest starts on its own.

5
00:00:19.981 --> 00:00:24.941
The line below says where the time came from. Tap Edit to change your default.

6
00:00:25.291 --> 00:00:29.531
Need a little less today? Tap the minus 15 seconds button.

7
00:00:29.894 --> 00:00:33.894
To rest that long on this lift every time, tap Keep.

8
00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:38.659
Tap the Back to workout button. A bar keeps counting while you log.
